= Norman Tebbit

[? if con_in_government = 1 and employment_secretary == "Tebbit" : Secretary of State for Employment. ?][? if con_in_government = 0 : A backbench scourge of Labour. ?] A former airline pilot and union official, he enjoys a fight, and Labour MPs call him "the Chingford Skinhead".

